{
    "title": "Moba League:PvP Trainer",
    "description": "\u2605\u2605 An easy-to-play 5v5 MOBA - Multiplayer Online Battle Arena \u2605\u2605\r\nA mobile AOS you can casually play anytime, anywhere!!\r\nBuild your own strategy to conquer the battlefield.\r\n\r\nEasy and simple MOBA with 100MB!!  \r\nMOBA Rookies who want to become World Champions,\r\nLet's do it together!!!!\r\n\r\n[Features]\r\n* Simple and easy controls\r\n  - Intuitive user interface and speedy AI match!!\r\n  - Make a Pentakill with simple controls!!\r\n  - No more boring lane battles!! Exchange kills wildly!!\r\n\r\n* Various unique Heroes\r\n  - Dozens of unique and distinctive Hero characters!\r\n  - So exciting! Clear Growth Missions to get new characters!\r\n  - Get more and more juicy rewards from Battle Pass by playing the game!\r\n - Heroes Evolve!\r\n\r\n* Challenge to the top! Rank Battle\r\n  - Prove your skills in Rank Battle!\r\n  - Control competition with the high Rankers!\r\n  - Move up to the highest League to become the World Legend!\r\n\r\n* Get a victory with your teammates\r\n- A real-time PvP action where you can create\r\n various teams made up of your friends' Heroes!\r\n- Lead and command your team using your own strategy!\r\n- Be the ACE of the winning team to get more rewards!\r\n\r\n* Different modes, different fun - Strategy Map\r\n  - \"Forest\" mode where various strategies are used on three different lanes!\r\n  - New Strategy Modes to be updated soon!\r\n\r\nThe ultimate mobile MOBA, \"Masters Battle League 5v5\"!!\r\nBe the true champion!! Challenge to be the Top Ranker!!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2605\u2605 An easy-to-play 5v5 MOBA - Multiplayer Online Battle Arena \u2605\u2605<br>A mobile AOS you can casually play anytime, anywhere!!<br>Build your own strategy to conquer the battlefield.<br><br>Easy and simple MOBA with 100MB!!  <br>MOBA Rookies who want to become World Champions,<br>Let&#39;s do it together!!!!<br><br>[Features]<br>* Simple and easy controls<br>  - Intuitive user interface and speedy AI match!!<br>  - Make a Pentakill with simple controls!!<br>  - No more boring lane battles!! Exchange kills wildly!!<br><br>* Various unique Heroes<br>  - Dozens of unique and distinctive Hero characters!<br>  - So exciting! Clear Growth Missions to get new characters!<br>  - Get more and more juicy rewards from Battle Pass by playing the game!<br> - Heroes Evolve!<br><br>* Challenge to the top! Rank Battle<br>  - Prove your skills in Rank Battle!<br>  - Control competition with the high Rankers!<br>  - Move up to the highest League to become the World Legend!<br><br>* Get a victory with your teammates<br>- A real-time PvP action where you can create<br> various teams made up of your friends&#39; Heroes!<br>- Lead and command your team using your own strategy!<br>- Be the ACE of the winning team to get more rewards!<br><br>* Different modes, different fun - Strategy Map<br>  - &quot;Forest&quot; mode where various strategies are used on three different lanes!<br>  - New Strategy Modes to be updated soon!<br><br>The ultimate mobile MOBA, &quot;Masters Battle League 5v5&quot;!!<br>Be the true champion!! Challenge to be the Top Ranker!!",
